+\[
+A=N_m/2-\sum_i a_i{\bf 1}\{a_i<1/2\},\qquad
+B=N_m-\sum_i a_i
+\]
+satisfy \(A+B\ge N_m/2\), so one of the two deadlines has regret at least \(N_m/4\) from that block.
